MODULE: AdmissionCrashDropsHistory
TARGET: HistoryRetained
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Reactivation loses a durable committed history slice
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<decision,source,installed,appended,applied,dropped,done,value,history,ckpt>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ history' = {}
    /\ UNCHANGED <<decision,source,installed,appended,applied,dropped,done,value,ckpt>>
--- END
